~ start
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Farah: hi!

=> one_heart

=> END

~ one_heart
%
	Farah: Violet, right? 
	$> Global.expression = "elated"
	Farah: it's nice to see you again!!
	$> Global.expression = "happy"
	Farah: how has your day been?
	- good
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: yayy! that's good [$> Global.far_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2]
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: I hope the rest of your day is good too
	- bad
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Farah: aww, how come?  [$> Global.far_meter -= 5][$> Global.happiness += 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Farah: wait, actually you don't have to tell me
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Farah: I mean you can, if you want, I just don't want to pry into personal issues, y'know?
		Farah: anyway, I hope your day gets better
		Farah: stay strong!!
	=> questions
% 
	Farah: I like your pencil case
	- thank you!
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: no problem! [$> Global.happiness += 2]
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: I mean, it is really cute, hehe
	- it's from ...
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: ooo ok, I was wondering hehe [$> Global.far_meter += 4][$> Global.happiness -= 2]
		Farah: I think I've heard of that store!
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: I'll have to check it out sometime then!
	- it was a gift 
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: ahh, that's nice! [$> Global.far_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: they picked a good gift then, hehe!
	=> questions
%
	Farah: do you get what's going on right now?
	- yea, are you slow?
		$> Global.expression = "laugh"
		Farah: oh haha... yea, I guess I am [$> Global.far_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness += 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: But yay! I'm happy you get it though
	- I think
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: hehe, that's better then no! [$> Global.far_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2]
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Farah: umm, can you help me with this question...
		- sure
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Farah: really? thank you so much!!  [$> Global.far_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2]
			$> Global.expression = "unsure"
			Farah: ...
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Farah: ok! I think I get it now
			Farah: you're really good at explaining it!
		- hold on a sec
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Farah: ok! [$> Global.far_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness += 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Farah: ...
			$> Global.expression = "laugh"
			Farah: actually, nevermind, it's ok!
	=> questions
=> END

~ questions
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Farah: ...
- compliment
	% => good
	%2 => bad
- joke 
	% => joke_good
	% => joke_bad
- open up [if Global.far_meter > Global.FOUR_HEARTS]
- end convo
=> END

~ good
Farah: ...  [$> Global.far_meter += 4][$> Global.happiness += 2]
$> Global.expression = "elated"
Farah: aww, really?
Farah: thanks Violet!
=> bell
=> END

~ bad
Farah: ... [$> Global.far_meter -= 4][$> Global.happiness -= 4][$> Global.wrong += 1]
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
Farah: oh, ok haha...
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_good
Farah: ... [$> Global.far_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
$> Global.expression = "elated"
Farah: hehehe
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_bad
Farah: ... [$> Global.far_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
Farah: oh, haha...
=> bell
=> END

~ bell
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Farah: ok, let's focus now!
=> END